XPath Locator Practice

Demo page:
https://www.selenium.dev/selenium/web/locators_tests/locators.html

Use XPath expressions only:

1. Find the first-name field by its ID and verify its value is "Jane".
2. Find the newsletter checkbox by its name and type.
3. Verify that the checkbox is initially unchecked, click it, then verify that it is selected.
4. Find the "Selenium Official Page" link by its visible text and verify its URL.
